                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Another to the custodian, Don Julio Silva.</hi></head>
                <p>On the proper day, and at 1 p.m., was made known to Don Julio Silva the foregoing
                    order.</p>
                <p>Signed and certified.</p>
                <closer><signed><list>
                            <item>SILVA.</item>
                            <item>ALVAREZ.</item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
